flowchart TD
  A[Verified identity] --> B[Membership resolver]
  B --> C[Immutable tenant context]
  C --> D[Application service]
  D --> E[DB transaction + RLS]
  D --> F[Vector query: tenant filter before top-k]
  D --> G[Cache key includes tenant]
  D --> H[Server-owned object reference]
  D --> I[Queue: actor + tenant + resource]
  I --> J[Worker revalidates membership and ownership]
  E --> K[Redacted audit]
  F --> K
  G --> K
  H --> K
  J --> K
  X[Untrusted tenant field / forged job] -. reject .-> B
  X -. reject .-> J
